              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Post-Graduation Destination: Institute of Cognitive Science, Garden Star of Botanical Study"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-f5bac45027f6e80b"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "My Interests"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Favorite Color: White"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Dream Destination: The Seaside"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Favorite Animal: Hallucigenia"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Ideal Career: Teacher"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-c3991990ba0c1755"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Messages from Classmates"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Graduation day has finally arrived. But so many never made it back."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "If I hadn't slipped away early that day... could I have done something for them? When I look at the empty seats in our classroom, I often feel guilty for being powerless. Fulwish, did you feel the same?"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "But I've come to terms with it now. The past is the past. Those of us left behind... we have to take care of ourselves."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "I hear the climate on Garden Star of Botanical Study is very different. Take care of yourself, Fulwish."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "— Sia"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-7a6342470e1ba984"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Winning first place in the campus imagenesis competition, ranking at the top for several consecutive semesters... You have always been outstanding, Fulwish."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "That's why I truly believe you can make it through that nightmare and show all of Planarcadia, with a smile, that we won't be easily defeated by a single tragedy. I've never doubted that."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "A new chapter in life is about to begin. Facing the lens of life, please keep on smiling!"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "— Sara"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-95839323e7f31e34"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Message from a Teacher"
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Hearing that you will soon leave Planarcadia to pursue cognitive science, I can't help but feel a sense of loss. It's a failure on my part as a teacher that I couldn't inspire you to stay in the imagenesis industry."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "But as your teacher, I fully understand your choice. To have helped shape a researcher like you for the Intelligentsia Guild fills me with deep pride."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "I sincerely wish you the vastest of horizons, Fulwish. May you realize your dreams, and may the sorrow sown in the past blossom into flowers of happiness in the future."
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "— Hermien"
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-f728b4e8d9850c0e"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "strong",
